{"id":"npc:%E4%BD%A9%E5%A1%94","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"特米米部族的阿达克利斯人，作为族群的勇士参加了祭典比武，却因为被幻觉中的刻俄柏误伤而出局。虽然表示了对特米米的计划的担忧，但还是为了留下嘉维尔而参与了计划。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情RI-3 往昔、RI-6 邂逅等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_070.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_03_beg","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":15,"line":16,"speaker":"佩塔","text":"——！（胜利的战吼）"},{"commandIndex":132,"line":133,"speaker":"佩塔","text":"你在说什么？"},{"commandIndex":147,"line":148,"speaker":"佩塔","text":"咕哈！"}]},{"story":"activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_end","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":12,"line":13,"speaker":"佩塔","text":"火石部族还有粗尾部族被一个不知道哪里来的背着很多武器的家伙给全打趴下了。"},{"commandIndex":26,"line":27,"speaker":"佩塔","text":"佩塔觉得，这样不好。"},{"commandIndex":42,"line":43,"speaker":"佩塔","text":"……佩塔不喜欢，但是佩塔会做。"}]}]}